ead" data-nc="" data-nr="" class="b_dmtab" style=" width:63px;" data-w="63" data-ow="95" data-content="tab_8_FBB307" tabindex="-1" role="tab" aria-controls="tab_8_FBB307" aria-selected="false" data-appns="SERP" data-k="5682.1" data-tabindex="6" data-bm="29">Behavior</li><li data-dataurl="/wiki?hash=2B47BE55BDEDC04E0016&order=1%2c2%2c3%2c4%2c5%2c6%2c7%2c8&width=648&open=7&accId=WikiRichcard&appNS=SERP&containsHeroSection=False&DataSource=DefaultProd" id="tab_9_FBB33B_head" data-nc="" data-nr="" class="b_dmtab" style=" width:141px;" data-w="141" data-ow="173" data-content="tab_9_FBB33B" tabindex="-1" role="tab" aria-controls="tab_9_FBB33B" aria-selected="false" data-appns="SERP" data-k="5683.1" data-tabindex="7" data-bm="30">Lifespan and health</li></ul></div><div id="tabcontrol_10_FBB42B_navr" class="tab-navr" data-appns="SERP" data-k="5829.1"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 16 16" enable-background="new 0 0 16 16" width="16" height="40"><path class="sv_ch" d="M3.735 1.366l6.634 6.634-6.634 6.634c-.313.313-.313.819 0 1.131.313.313.819.313 1.131 0l7.2-7.2c.148-.148.234-.355.234-.565 0-.21-.086-.417-.234-.566l-7.2-7.2c-.313-.313-.819-.313-1.131 0s-.313.82 0 1.132z" /></svg></div></div><div class="tab-content"><div id="tab_2_FBA75C" data-appns="SERP" data-k="5614.2" role="tabpanel" aria-labelledby="tab_2_FBA75C_head" data-priority=""><div class="b_clearfix b_overflow"><div class="b_floatR_img"><div class="cico" style="width:100px;height:100px;"><img height="100" width="100" data-src-hq="https://th.bing.com/th/id/ODL.89391e484d2e1ab476d357043083679a?w=100&h=100&c=12&pcl=faf9f7&o=6&pid=AlgoBlockDebug" role="presentation" data-priority="2" id="emb13237D5DE" class="rms_img" src="https://th.bing.com/th/id/ODL.89391e484d2e1ab476d357043083679a?w=100&h=100&c=12&pcl=faf9f7&o=6&pid=AlgoBlockDebug" loading="lazy" data-bm="43"></div></div><p class="b_paractl">The cat (Felis catus), also called the house cat or domestic cat,    is a small <a target="_blank" href="https://www.bing.com/ck/a?!&&p=0a3cf4a5fc558e8d06e69e307ae61c7f4e3886f3d74e2eb6a5aef8c6093c6896JmltdHM9MTc3ODk3NjAwMA&ptn=3&ver=2&hsh=4&fclid=3e054015-7928-611b-3a23-574978ef6000&u=a1L3NlYXJjaD9xPUNhcm5pdm9yZSUyMHdpa2lwZWRpYSZmb3JtPVdJS0lSRQ&ntb=1" h="ID=SERP,5643.1">carnivorous</a> mammal. It is an <a target="_blank" href="https://www.bing.com/ck/a?!&&p=bdf6fdad27851b70cdceac4c83d882a53137c5de7245f08389b65bcc19704c9bJmltdHM9MTc3ODk3NjAwMA&ptn=3&ver=2&hsh=4&fclid=3e054015-7928-611b-3a23-574978ef6000&u=a1L3NlYXJjaD9xPU9ibGlnYXRlJTIwY2Fybml2b3JlJTIwd2lraXBlZGlhJmZvcm09V0lLSVJF&ntb=1" h="ID=SERP,5644.1">obligate carnivore</a>, requiring a predominantly meat-based diet. Its retractable <a target="_blank" href="https://www.bing.com/ck/a?!&&p=57a9b18c1984442be0feadb86381b425668f3c20c948b150d5aa00c1ed181a69JmltdHM9MTc3ODk3NjAwMA&ptn=3&ver=2&hsh=4&fclid=3e054015-7928-611b-3a23-574978ef6000&u=a1L3NlYXJjaD9xPUNsYXclMjB3aWtpcGVkaWEmZm9ybT1XSUtJUkU&ntb=1" h="ID=SERP,5645.1">claws</a> are adapted to killing small prey species such as <a target="_blank" href="https://www.bing.com/ck/a?!&&p=7b00bab2a48cb2f86769aa2879feedee0a57462861966966adec7cd03ff1fa31JmltdHM9MTc3ODk3NjAwMA&ptn=3&ver=2&hsh=4&fclid=3e054015-7928-611b-3a23-574978ef6000&u=a1L3NlYXJjaD9xPU1pY2UlMjB3aWtpcGVkaWEmZm9ybT1XSUtJUkU&ntb=1" h="ID=SERP,5646.1">mice</a> and <a target="_blank" href="https://www.bing.com/ck/a?!&&p=f9b2c9732d03926b390eca8a3907c68673a28ca17c2d8d0d67c5d68cd681c693JmltdHM9MTc3ODk3NjAwMA&ptn=3&ver=2&hsh=4&fclid=3e054015-7928-611b-3a23-574978ef6000&u=a1L3NlYXJjaD9xPVJhdCUyMHdpa2lwZWRpYSZmb3JtPVdJS0lSRQ&ntb=1" h="ID=SERP,5647.1">rats</a>. It has a strong, flexible body, quick <a target="_blank" href="https://www.bing.com/ck/a?!&&p=44a4a2b9a9e2e006557e89575c6e06cf00aced35b082c425321eaf3dd3dea56fJmltdHM9MTc3ODk3NjAwMA&ptn=3&ver=2&hsh=4&fclid=3e054015-7928-611b-3a23-574978ef6000&u=a1L3NlYXJjaD9xPVJlZmxleCUyMHdpa2lwZWRpYSZmb3JtPVdJS0lSRQ&ntb=1" h="ID=SERP,5648.1">reflexes</a>, and sharp teeth, and its <a target="_blank" href="https://www.bing.com/ck/a?!&&p=ae927c2314c929a0aef59898e79242102e35cdf9d9541613520d750dc4f68a74JmltdHM9MTc3ODk3NjAwMA&ptn=3&ver=2&hsh=4&fclid=3e054015-7928-611b-3a23-574978ef6000&u=a1L3NlYXJjaD9xPU5pZ2h0JTIwdmlzaW9uJTIwd2lraXBlZGlhJmZvcm09V0lLSVJF&ntb=1" h="ID=SERP,5649.1">night vision</a> and <a target="_blank" href="https://www.bing.com/ck/a?!&&p=434c8650474b962df544a2b43e4c58b777e0f6f6f3e584e9849b63646d1a53beJmltdHM9MTc3ODk3NjAwMA&ptn=3&ver=2&hsh=4&fclid=3e054015-7928-611b-3a23-574978ef6000&u=a1L3NlYXJjaD9xPVNlbnNlJTIwb2YlMjBzbWVsbCUyMHdpa2lwZWRpYSZmb3JtPVdJS0lSRQ&ntb=1" h="ID=SERP,5650.1">sense of smell</a> are well developed. It is a <a target="_blank" href="https://www.bing.com/ck/a?!&&p=23f20857c4cc090721c6922381e98ddafbe69738538c3514a1362fc0bd569ff6JmltdHM9MTc3ODk3NjAwMA&ptn=3&ver=2&hsh=4&fclid=3e054015-7928-611b-3a23-574978ef6000&u=a1L3NlYXJjaD9xPVNvY2lhbCUyMHNwZWNpZXMlMjB3aWtpcGVkaWEmZm9ybT1XSUtJUkU&ntb=1" h="ID=SERP,5651.1">social species</a>, but a solitary hunter and a <a target="_blank" href="https://www.bing.com/ck/a?!&&p=55b93e2666d7d1336d8a492a1e05888a485af8d8ff8466b42e48339056fcb277JmltdHM9MTc3ODk3NjAwMA&ptn=3&ver=2&hsh=4&fclid=3e054015-7928-611b-3a23-574978ef6000&u=a1L3NlYXJjaD9xPUNyZXB1c2N1bGFyJTIwd2lraXBlZGlhJmZvcm09V0lLSVJF&ntb=1" h="ID=SERP,5652.1">crepuscular</a>  </p></div></div><div id="tab_3_FBB177" class="tab-hide" data-appns="SERP" data-k="5677.2" role="tabpanel" aria-labelledby="tab_3_FBB177_head" data-priority="2"></div><div id="tab_4_FBB214" class="tab-hide" data-appns="SERP" data-k="5678.2" role="tabpanel" aria-labelledby="tab_4_FBB214_head" data-priority="2"></div><div id="tab_5_FBB256" class="tab-hide" data-appns="SERP" data-k="5679.2" role="tabpanel" aria-labelledby="tab_5_FBB256_head" data-priority="2"></div><div id="tab_6_FBB296" class="tab-hide" data-appns="SERP" data-k="5680.2" role="tabpanel" aria-labelledby="tab_6_FBB296_head" data-priority="2"></div><div id="tab_7_FBB2D6" class="tab-hide" data-appns=